 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. EF4-CAMEL-HEAD.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-YAW                 FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-PITCH               FLOAT-LONG.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-IN.
    05 L-I                 FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 16 TIMES.
 01 L-OUT.
    05 L-O                 FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 64 TIMES.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-IN L-OUT.
     MOVE L-I(1) TO WS-YAW
     IF WS-YAW > 30
         MOVE 30 TO WS-YAW
     END-IF
     IF WS-YAW < -30
         MOVE -30 TO WS-YAW
     END-IF
     MOVE L-I(2) TO WS-PITCH
     IF WS-PITCH > 45
         MOVE 45 TO WS-PITCH
     END-IF
     IF WS-PITCH < -25
         MOVE -25 TO WS-PITCH
     END-IF
     IF L-I(3) > 0
         COMPUTE WS-PITCH = WS-PITCH + 45 * L-I(3) / 55
         IF WS-PITCH > 70
             MOVE 70 TO WS-PITCH
         END-IF
         IF WS-PITCH < -25
             MOVE -25 TO WS-PITCH
         END-IF
     END-IF
     COMPUTE L-O(1) = WS-YAW * 0.017453292
     COMPUTE L-O(2) = WS-PITCH * 0.017453292
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM EF4-CAMEL-HEAD.

